Package: BioInfoAfterSale
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Bioinformatics After-Sales Analysis Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xinyin", "Deng", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "DengXinyin@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides simple, reusable entry points for bioinformatics
    after-sales analyses. The first module runs GO or KEGG over-representation
    analysis with 'clusterProfiler', visualizes enrichment results with
    'enrichplot' and 'ggplot2', and exposes common report styling options.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    clusterProfiler,
    enrichplot,
    ggplot2,
    graphics,
    methods
Suggests:
    org.Hs.eg.db,
    org.Mm.eg.db,
    org.Rn.eg.db,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
